{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"thread\": \"一个人渐渐爱上了一个愿意陪伴自己的人，却始终害怕自己表现得太在乎，会给对方造成负担，甚至失去这份亲近。经历反复的克制、试探、被看见后的不安，以及重新获得安全感后，他终于接受感情无法保证永远，决定不再隐藏自己的喜欢，好好珍惜眼前的人。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"caught\": \"心动却怕露太多\",\n      \"echo\": \"\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"caught\": \"被接纳后甜中带酸\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"caught\": \"享受当下，想说又作罢\",\n      \"echo\": \"S02\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"caught\": \"想坦白又怕伤了自在\",\n      \"echo\": \"S03\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"caught\": \"心意被看穿后慌了\",\n      \"echo\": \"S04\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"caught\": \"对方没变，心里仍孤单\",\n      \"echo\": \"S05\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"caught\": \"觉得自己也被需要\",\n      \"echo\": \"S06\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"caught\": \"主动回应又怕好景不长\",\n      \"echo\": \"S07\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"caught\": \"怕有天不再被需要\",\n      \"echo\": \"S08\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"caught\": \"放下猜测，享受当下\",\n      \"echo\": \"S09\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"caught\": \"想一直陪伴却怕无回应\",\n      \"echo\": \"S10\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"caught\": \"不再克制，尽情去爱\",\n      \"echo\": \"S11\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"caught\": \"想要永远，又想藏起喜欢\",\n      \"echo\": \"S01\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"caught\": \"接受未知，不再藏喜欢\",\n      \"echo\": \"S13\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"最吃力的是 S05，只有18秒，却连续发生心意暴露、失去安全感、害怕被嫌弃三个变化，扫读时容易来不及消化。最抓人的是 S13–S14：刚刚尽情表达喜欢的人，又因为害怕失去而想退回去，最后却选择不再隐藏，这个前后呼应让整个故事有了真正的落点。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "e2f80095-e6eb-4509-bd96-9e4c17d330f2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T183607993436Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.547, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T18:36:52.561501+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5e228a1273735aa3654f36bd53f07b4430bc946be1c55ca4cf151a0a219c9dd7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T183607993436Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "55949394fa95d73befe005a6d1f642e910786db0a65c7a000b855b06617fdac6"}}}
